        "id": "proswell_idm_chiptune_demo",
        "title": "Proswell-style IDM/Chiptune Sketch",
        "description": "A short IDM-meets-chiptune sketch in A minor. The DrumSequencer runs in **song mode** with four distinct sections (A=intro / B=verse / C=chorus / D=break-fill), each held for 4 bars before auto-advancing — a 16-bar arrangement. Chord pad cycles Am — F — C — G under a square sub bass; a Tracker channel carries the lead melody with pitch wobble (pb) and a pressure climax. Demonstrates the Phase 4 Tracker expression authoring + Phase 5 universal pressure/timbre wiring.",
