            "text": "**Proswell-style IDM/chiptune** — A minor, 92 BPM.\n\n**Drums** (song mode, 4×4-bar sections):\n  A = intro · B = verse · C = chorus · D = break-fill\n**Chord pad**: ChordProgression Am-F-C-G into WavetableLayer.\n**Bass**: NotePattern walks roots into SubOsc square -1 oct.\n**Lead**: Tracker pattern with pb wobble + pressure swell into AnalogOsc Pulse.\n\nOpen the DrumSequencer editor — the section picker shows A/B/C/D.",
